Use Logica Context MCP tools to keep raw data in the sandbox:
- `lctx_batch_execute` for research (commands + queries in one call)
- `lctx_search` for follow-up questions
- `lctx_execute` for log analysis and data processing
- `lctx_fetch_and_index` instead of fetching URLs directly
